                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "MA continues to lead the way on providing reliable healthcare coverage and lowering prices for families. Due to the ConnectorCare pilot expansion, implemented this year as a result of enhanced ACA credits passed through @WaysMeansCmte, MA residents are seeing tangible benefits both in their doctor\u2019s office and in their wallets.\n\nRead more below:",
