                "text": "Nearly 24 million Americans signed up for health insurance coverage during this season's open enrollment - and open enrollment is still OPEN!\n\nA total of 45 million Americans now have coverage through the Affordable Care Act.\n\nStill thinking about repealing the ACA? I think 45 million Americans would have something to say about that.",
