                "text": "We've seen this game before.\n\nRepublicans are doubling down on the same failed playbook. One that rigs the system for billionaires and big corporations, while everyone else pays the price.\n\nNamely, 14 million Americans who will lose health coverage. https://t.co/30y5wPo5y6",
