                "text": "Just yesterday, I heard from a constituent who received a notice from the MassHealth Connector. Their premiums are estimated to jump from $400 to $1,100 per month\u2014and for less coverage.\n\nIf we can afford tax cuts for the wealthiest Americans, we should be able to make health care affordable for working families and seniors. No one should have to choose between paying their medical bills and putting food on the table.",
